      "description": {
        "_type": "localizedPortableText",
        "de": [
          {
            "_key": "93b21a437208",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "6489c47c24a5",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Bringe 360 ml Wasser in einem Topf zum Kochen. Gib die Tteokbokki-Reiskuchen dazu. Wenn sie gefroren sind, weiche sie vorher kurz in Wasser ein. "
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "_key": "aecab3484320",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "ef84cb886d18",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Bring 360 ml of water to a boil in a pot. Add the tteokbokki rice cakes. If the rice cakes are frozen, soak them briefly in water first. "
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ]
      },
      "image": [],
      "ingredientsUsed": [],
      "legacyContentfulId": "7D025TPyvwF8T46n9QOn2r",
      "stepName": "TTK1",
      "stepNumber": 1
    },
    {
      "_createdAt": "2026-10-01T21:23:31Z",
      "_id": "2l8OctBJ2yLcMofEBZ7ncp",
      "_rev": "JvPYpz8fI9X3Uqv2WwVy0s",
      "_type": "step",
      "_updatedAt": "2026-10-01T21:23:31Z",
      "description": {
        "_type": "localizedPortableText",
        "de": [
          {
            "_key": "bd5707fa8529",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "78d66b924145",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Wenn das Wasser wieder kocht, gib die Sauce-Zutaten dazu und verrühre alles gut. Rühre während des Kochens regelmäßig um, damit die Reiskuchen nicht am Topfboden kleben bleiben. "
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "_key": "253f2a97f76c",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "e568c6ce9cd3",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "When the water starts boiling again, add the sauce ingredients and mix well. Keep stirring often while the rice cakes cook, so they do not stick to the bottom. "
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ]
      },
      "image": [],
      "ingredientsUsed": [],
      "legacyContentfulId": "2l8OctBJ2yLcMofEBZ7ncp",
      "stepName": "TTK2",
      "stepNumber": 2
    },
    {
      "_createdAt": "2026-10-01T21:23:31Z",
      "_id": "33TlrZWkEbVEJSoV3bPX7d",
      "_rev": "JvPYpz8fI9X3Uqv2WwVy0s",
      "_type": "step",
      "_updatedAt": "2026-10-01T21:23:31Z",
      "description": {
        "_type": "localizedPortableText",
        "de": [
          {
            "_key": "7efd33e867a3",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "a67445e9c97b",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Köchele alles, bis die Sauce etwas eingekocht ist und leicht glänzt. Schneide die Lauchzwiebel mit einer Schere klein und streue Sesam darüber. "
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "_key": "448c0be71a9e",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "9b04175a3205",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Simmer until the sauce has reduced and becomes slightly glossy. Cut the green onion into small pieces with scissors and sprinkle sesame seeds on top. "
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ]
      },
      "image": [],
      "ingredientsUsed": [],
      "legacyContentfulId": "33TlrZWkEbVEJSoV3bPX7d",
      "stepName": "TTK3",
